<title>GERMANY: Salamander Jan-May sales rise 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Salamander Jan-May sales rise 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KORNWESTHEIM, Germany 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German shoe company Salamander AG said on Friday sales rose five percent in the first five months of the year, and that it was profitable at the group level in the first four months.</p>
<p>The company, which lost 21.9 million marks on sales of 59 million marks last year, gave no precise figures for its five-month sales and four-month profit results.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
